that sometimes can get out.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:25.102
I think people should ban that word.

00:01:25.102 --> 00:01:28.484
And instead of saying that R word,

00:01:28.484 --> 00:01:30.680
have the R word be respect.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:33.023
- [Host] I am in a relationship.

