00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.920
because we are here

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.970
to have

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.040
great guys

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.180
to be in great in
relationship with ladies.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.070
But ladies, it's really tough right now.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:44.037
But

00:02:44.037 --> 00:02:45.720
for me,

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.503
I love my girlfriend.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.723
- [Host] I earn my own money.

00:02:55.468 --> 00:02:57.040
Wow.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:59.310
