make drinks and food.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:16.250
And ever since I dated him,
it makes my heart very happy

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:18.880
to see him grow.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.500
- It's very rewarding
to see what she does.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:23.783
