00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.450
I work hard.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:45.230
I want to be a billionaire
and a millionaire.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:49.350
As a woman, as Down syndrome as myself,

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.850
