00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.290
- [Matthew] That's true.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:20.060
Us kids with special needs
have dreams to follow.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:24.730
No matter what dream it is,
do what you can do the best.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.230
Don't let anyone take you down.

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:29.200
I love earning my own money.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.010
It feels great to know
that I did a good job

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:33.843
