00:04:33.843 --> 00:04:37.648
It makes me feel happy
that I did a great job.

00:04:37.648 --> 00:04:39.490
Even though I have Down syndrome

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:42.070
I earned that money
because I earned respect.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:45.590
So people out there who
think we can't do it,

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.090
